#!/usr/bin/env python
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
install_p6.py -- the five audience-facing Present fixes, merged into one run.

    python install_p6.py <path-to-T_Industries_SIREN_v1.html>

  1  BLOCK FRAMING      one node measurement (mapNodeUserRect), tiles promoted in
                        Build, a click steps in, the plane dims around the framed
                        thing, and the exported crop carries the focus rings.
  2  THE DECK CURSOR    mapGoToStop owns mapRouteIndex and the camera together;
                        one home for the home button and Escape; the bar says
                        "off the route" instead of naming a slide nobody can see.
  3  THE ORPHANED MENU  Escape closes an open structure menu before the deck hears
                        it, and every door out of a mode takes its menus with it.
  4  FIT TO BOX         presentFitBox, and the five surfaces that put a picture in
                        a rectangle routed through it: the PDF page, the .pptx
                        slide, the audience window, the Map tile, the plate.
  5  THE WALKTHROUGH    a diagram stop expands into the steps the room was walked
                        through, with each step's own note, behind one switch in
                        the export menu that prints the resulting slide count.

  +  THE MERGES         the two export patches both rewrote the PowerPoint driver
                        and both wanted mapViewSlideSvg. Resolved so the frame is
                        composed onto EVERY expanded step slide, the +N badge and
                        the "- exported" line count the real deck, the deferred
                        node re-aim cannot fire after the camera is pulled off the
                        route, and the veil goes out with it.

Every edit is anchored on text that must appear exactly the stated number of
times. Nothing is written unless every anchor matches. The write is atomic
(os.replace of a temp file in the same folder). Running it twice is a no-op.
"""
import io
import os
import sys
import tempfile

